cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below. Model weights and datasets have their own terms."
title: "Explainable Dermatology AI: Combining RL and XAI for Transparent Treatment and Diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype for dermatology decision support: a concept-bottleneck CNN
  (HRNet-W18 backbone) with Grad-CAM/Integrated-Gradients explanations, a
  contextual-bandit triage agent and a clinician-in-the-loop review workflow.
  Not a medical device; no clinical validation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jamesmutegeki/Derma_AI"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
keywords:
  - dermatology
  - concept-bottleneck-model
  - explainable-ai
  - fairness
  - reinforcement-learning
